#
# Fail-witness for ex:saTraceFinalityNoFormulaOutsideConstraint. A formula on the
# committed-point role that is not a node of any constraint's integrity tree, as
# a law or definition authored elsewhere would be. Unioned with the module, it
# makes the ban's ASK hold. The real module never carries it.

@prefix gmeow: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/> .
@prefix logic: <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/> .
@prefix ce:    <https://example.org/trace-finality/counter-examples/> .

ce:frontierPointLaw a logic:Formula ;
    logic:relation gmeow:frontierPoint ;
    logic:argument [ logic:termIndex 0 ; logic:termVariable "frontier" ] , [ logic:termIndex 1 ; logic:termVariable "point" ] .
